menu "WiFi Radar TX configuration"

config RADAR_AP_CHANNEL
    int "SoftAP channel (2.4 GHz)"
    range 1 13
    default 1
    help
        Channel used by the dedicated TX SoftAP. Use a matching channel
        plan on the Analyzer if a future build pins the station scan channel.
        Common non-overlapping choices are 1, 6 and 11.

endmenu
